  - "rotor analysis"
abstract: |
  WyndT is an open-source Python tool for preliminary aerodynamic analysis
  of wind turbine rotors using a 3D panel method. It provides an intuitive
  graphical interface for loading STL geometries, visualizing pressure
  distributions, and generating aerodynamic curves without requiring
  specialized CFD knowledge.
